{
  "provider": "linear",
  "protocol": "http",
  "display": {
    "name": "Linear",
    "category": "Issue tracking",
    "blurb": "Query and mutate Linear issues, projects, teams, and comments through its GraphQL API — authenticated with the workspace's OAuth app token, brokered at the egress proxy and never seen by the agent.",
    "icon": {
      "mono": "LI",
      "color": "#5e6ad2"
    }
  },
  "credential": {
    "source": "inject",
    "injects": [
      {
        "header": "Authorization",
        "template": "Bearer {}"
      }
    ]
  },
  "hosts": [
    "api.linear.app"
  ],
  "oauth": {
    "authorizeUrl": "https://linear.app/oauth/authorize",
    "acquisitionHosts": [
      "linear.app"
    ],
    "tokenUrl": "https://api.linear.app/oauth/token",
    "scopes": [
      "read",
      "write"
    ],
    "extraAuthorizeParams": {
      "actor": "app"
    },
    "clientIdRef": "linear.client_id",
    "clientSecretRef": "linear.client_secret",
    "metadata": {
      "probe": {
        "method": "POST",
        "path": "/graphql",
        "body": "{\"query\":\"{ viewer { id name } }\"}",
        "map": {
          "accountId": "data.viewer.id",
          "displayName": "data.viewer.name"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "test": {
    "path": "/graphql"
  },
  "operations": [
    {
      "grants": [
        "org:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "viewer"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "org:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "organization"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "org:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "teams"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "org:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "team"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "org:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "users"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "org:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "user"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "org:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "cycles"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "org:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "cycle"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "org:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "workflowStates"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "org:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "workflowState"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "issues"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "issue"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "issueSearch"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "comments"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "comment"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "attachments"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "attachment"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "issueLabels"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "issueLabel"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "issueCreate"
      },
      "comment": "GraphQL asset parity (PR #904 rules): responses echo only the client's selection set, so every field is response-first with a $.vars fallback, and issue URLs/identifiers additionally derive from the returned URL.",
      "asset": {
        "kind": "issue",
        "surface": "asset",
        "success": {
          "noGraphqlErrors": true
        },
        "data": {
          "identifier": [
            "$.resp.data.issueCreate.issue.identifier"
          ],
          "title": [
            "$.resp.data.issueCreate.issue.title",
            "$.vars.input.title"
          ],
          "team_id": [
            "$.vars.input.teamId"
          ]
        },
        "fetchable": {
          "external": "$.resp.data.issueCreate.issue.url"
        },
        "urlFallback": {
          "pattern": "https://linear.app/{workspace}/issue/{identifier}/{slug}",
          "fields": {
            "identifier": "{identifier}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "issueUpdate"
      },
      "comment": "GraphQL asset parity (PR #904 rules): responses echo only the client's selection set, so every field is response-first with a $.vars fallback, and issue URLs/identifiers additionally derive from the returned URL.",
      "asset": {
        "kind": "issue",
        "surface": "action",
        "success": {
          "noGraphqlErrors": true
        },
        "data": {
          "identifier": [
            "$.resp.data.issueUpdate.issue.identifier"
          ],
          "title": [
            "$.resp.data.issueUpdate.issue.title",
            "$.vars.input.title"
          ]
        },
        "fetchable": {
          "external": "$.resp.data.issueUpdate.issue.url"
        },
        "urlFallback": {
          "pattern": "https://linear.app/{workspace}/issue/{identifier}/{slug}",
          "fields": {
            "identifier": "{identifier}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "issueArchive"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "issueUnarchive"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "commentCreate"
      },
      "comment": "GraphQL asset parity (PR #904 rules): responses echo only the client's selection set, so every field is response-first with a $.vars fallback, and issue URLs/identifiers additionally derive from the returned URL.",
      "asset": {
        "kind": "comment",
        "surface": "action",
        "success": {
          "noGraphqlErrors": true
        },
        "data": {
          "issue_id": [
            "$.vars.input.issueId"
          ],
          "issue_identifier": [
            "$.resp.data.commentCreate.comment.issue.identifier"
          ]
        },
        "fetchable": {
          "external": "$.resp.data.commentCreate.comment.url"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "commentUpdate"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "attachmentCreate"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "attachmentLinkURL"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "issueLabelCreate"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "issues:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "reactionCreate"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "projects:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "projects"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "projects:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "project"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "projects:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "projectUpdates"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "projects:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "projectUpdate"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "projects:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "initiatives"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "projects:read"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "query",
        "field": "initiative"
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "projects:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "projectCreate"
      },
      "comment": "GraphQL asset parity (PR #904 rules): responses echo only the client's selection set, so every field is response-first with a $.vars fallback, and issue URLs/identifiers additionally derive from the returned URL.",
      "asset": {
        "kind": "project",
        "surface": "asset",
        "success": {
          "noGraphqlErrors": true
        },
        "data": {
          "name": [
            "$.resp.data.projectCreate.project.name",
            "$.vars.input.name"
          ]
        },
        "fetchable": {
          "external": "$.resp.data.projectCreate.project.url"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "projects:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "projectUpdate"
      },
      "comment": "GraphQL asset parity (PR #904 rules): responses echo only the client's selection set, so every field is response-first with a $.vars fallback, and issue URLs/identifiers additionally derive from the returned URL.",
      "asset": {
        "kind": "project",
        "surface": "action",
        "success": {
          "noGraphqlErrors": true
        },
        "data": {
          "name": [
            "$.resp.data.projectUpdate.project.name",
            "$.vars.input.name"
          ]
        },
        "fetchable": {
          "external": "$.resp.data.projectUpdate.project.url"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "grants": [
        "projects:write"
      ],
      "match": {
        "operation": "mutation",
        "field": "projectUpdateCreate"
      },
      "comment": "GraphQL asset parity (PR #904 rules): responses echo only the client's selection set, so every field is response-first with a $.vars fallback, and issue URLs/identifiers additionally derive from the returned URL.",
      "asset": {
        "kind": "project_update",
        "surface": "asset",
        "success": {
          "noGraphqlErrors": true
        },
        "data": {
          "project_id": [
            "$.vars.input.projectId"
          ]
        },
        "fetchable": {
          "external": "$.resp.data.projectUpdateCreate.projectUpdate.url"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "cli": {
    "bins": [
      "linear"
    ],
    "binSource": "bundled",
    "dummyEnv": {
      "LINEAR_API_KEY": "x-engrams-managed"
    },
    "credentialDelivery": "inject",
    "doc": "Use `linear` to query and mutate Linear from this session via its GraphQL API. Authentication is automatic: the egress proxy injects the workspace's Linear OAuth app token (actor=app — actions attribute to the workspace's agent app user) on requests to api.linear.app; `LINEAR_API_KEY` is a managed placeholder. Do NOT set a real key or run any login.\n\nLinear is a GraphQL-only API: ONE endpoint, POST https://api.linear.app/graphql. Powers gate the TOP-LEVEL GraphQL fields a request may select, by product area:\n  org:read        viewer, organization, team(s), user(s), cycle(s), workflowState(s)\n  issues:read     issue(s), issueSearch, comment(s), attachment(s), issueLabel(s)\n  issues:write    issueCreate/Update/Archive/Unarchive, commentCreate/Update, attachmentCreate, attachmentLinkURL, issueLabelCreate, reactionCreate\n  projects:read   project(s), projectUpdate(s), initiative(s)\n  projects:write  projectCreate, projectUpdate, projectUpdateCreate\nA request must have EVERY top-level field it selects covered by a granted power, or the proxy rejects it before it leaves the sandbox.\n\nSubcommands (all run a GraphQL document; the power each needs):\n  linear whoami                       Current identity (`viewer`) — org:read.\n  linear teams                        List your teams — org:read.\n  linear issues [query]               Search issues by free text — issues:read.\n  linear issue <id>                   Fetch one issue by id or identifier (e.g. ENG-123) — issues:read.\n  linear projects                     List projects — projects:read.\n  linear comment <issueId> <text>     Add a comment — issues:write.\n  linear create <teamId> <title> [description]   Create an issue — issues:write.\n  linear query '<graphql>' [varsJSON] Run an arbitrary query or mutation (covered fields only).\n  linear raw '<json-body>'            POST a raw GraphQL JSON body verbatim (covered fields only).\n\nExamples:\n  linear whoami\n  linear issues \"login bug\"\n  linear query 'query{ teams{ nodes{ id name } } }'\n  linear query 'mutation($t:String!){ issueCreate(input:{teamId:\"...\",title:$t}){ success issue{ identifier } } }' '{\"t\":\"New bug\"}'\n\nResponses are JSON of the form {\"data\":{...}} or {\"errors\":[...]}. GraphQL can return HTTP 200 with an `errors` array; a missing/invalid token yields HTTP 401 with extensions.type=authentication_error. A request selecting a field outside your granted powers is refused at the network boundary (not a Linear error)."
  },
  "graphqlEndpoint": "/graphql"
}
